      "type": "text", "id": "ev_t", "x": 36, "y": 526, "width": 780, "height": 83,
      "text": "Malfurion Stormrage   SkyCraft-Admins       Owner       subscription, inherited by all RGs\nKhadgar Archmage      SkyCraft-Developers   Contributor dev-skycraft-swc-rg\nChromie Timewalker    SkyCraft-Testers      Reader      dev + prod, read only\nIllidan Stormrage     none (B2B guest)      Reader      platform-skycraft-swc-rg\n\n# roles land on groups, never on people — except the guest, scoped directly",
